# MECHFALL // FORGE 77 — COMPLETE TWEAKXL TEMPLATE (EXAMPLE ONLY)
# ==================================================================
# STATUS: complete original record definitions, structurally validated by
#         tools/validate_integration.py. STILL NOT INSTALLED and STILL NOT
#         VALIDATED against CP2077 2.31 / TweakXL. The installable path in this
#         repository is CET-only (init.lua); this file lives in docs/integration/.
#
# WHY NOT INSTALLED: an unvalidated TweakXL patch can override game records at
# launch. Copy into a WolvenKit/TweakXL project, validate against patch 2.31,
# and test in-game. No base-mod records, types or display names are referenced.
# No Donation Points / derivative asset use. All ids below are original.
#
# TARGET PATCH: CP2077 2.31 (CET 1.37.1 + RED4ext 1.29/1.30).

